{"id":"4f47f83c51f651d3","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system.md","title":"Many-sorted rewriting","display":"df-many-sorted-rewrite-system — Many-sorted rewriting","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system","aliases":["56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system"],"display":"df-many-sorted-rewrite-system — Many-sorted rewriting","depends_on":["[[56-df-many-sorted-terms]]","[[56-df-many-sorted-substitution]]","[[56-df-variables]]","[[56-df-position]]","[[56-df-subterm]]","[[56-df-replace]]"],"source_section":"§6.5.6","source_printed_pages":"256","source_ocr_blocks":[277],"source_verification":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-many-sorted-rewrite-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-many-sorted-rewrite-system — Many-sorted rewriting"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0eb06f5a064870f0\" href=\"?note=0eb06f5a064870f0\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-terms\">56-df-many-sorted-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2d69158e5cbd8317\" href=\"?note=2d69158e5cbd8317\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-substitution\">56-df-many-sorted-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§6.5.6"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"256"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>277</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书文字层定位与数学陈述比对；本地展开及证明范围见 Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V_\\bullet\">\\(\\mathcal V_\\bullet\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_s\">\\(T_s\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_S\">\\(T_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\circ}\">\\(T^{\\circ}\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0eb06f5a064870f0\" href=\"?note=0eb06f5a064870f0\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-terms\">56-df-many-sorted-terms</a>；排序替换集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2d69158e5cbd8317\" href=\"?note=2d69158e5cbd8317\" title=\"56-df-many-sorted-substitution\">56-df-many-sorted-substitution</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}:T^{\\circ}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal V)\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}:T^{\\circ}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal V)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"491e726b9c1f42b0\" href=\"?note=491e726b9c1f42b0\" title=\"56-df-variables\">56-df-variables</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pos}\">\\(\\operatorname{Pos}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t|_p\">\\(t|_p\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[u]_p\">\\(t[u]_p\\)</span> 分别取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"da02033e6d596cae\" href=\"?note=da02033e6d596cae\" title=\"56-df-position\">56-df-position</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c3157a722a0edf96\" href=\"?note=c3157a722a0edf96\" title=\"56-df-subterm\">56-df-subterm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"b58d01262349aaf3\" href=\"?note=b58d01262349aaf3\" title=\"56-df-replace\">56-df-replace</a> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{\\circ}\">\\(T^{\\circ}\\)</span> 上的接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq T^{\\circ}\\times T^{\\circ}\">\\(R\\subseteq T^{\\circ}\\times T^{\\circ}\\)</span>；每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(l,r)\\in R\">\\((l,r)\\in R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"l\\notin\\mathcal V\">\\(l\\notin\\mathcal V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}(r)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}(l)\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}(r)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}(l)\\)</span> 以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists s\\in S\\;(l\\in T_s\\land r\\in T_s)\">\\(\\exists s\\in S\\;(l\\in T_s\\land r\\in T_s)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\sigma\">\\(t\\sigma\\)</span> 使用排序替换原子明确引用的底层项替换延拓。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rule}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{s\\in S}\\{(l,r)\\in T_s\\times T_s\\mid\nl\\notin\\mathcal V\\land\\operatorname{Var}(r)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}(l)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Rule}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{s\\in S}\\{(l,r)\\in T_s\\times T_s\\mid\nl\\notin\\mathcal V\\land\\operatorname{Var}(r)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Var}(l)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TRS}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Rule}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TRS}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\coloneqq\n\\mathcal P(\\operatorname{Rule}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R\\in\\operatorname{TRS}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^S\\;\\coloneqq\n\\{(t,u)\\in T_S\\times T^{\\circ}\\mid\n\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)\\,\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\,\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\;\n(t|_p=l\\sigma\\land u=t[r\\sigma]_p)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\to_R^S\\;\\coloneqq\n\\{(t,u)\\in T_S\\times T^{\\circ}\\mid\n\\exists p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(t)\\,\\exists(l,r)\\in R\\,\n\\exists\\sigma\\in\\operatorname{Sub}_S(M,\\mathcal V_\\bullet)\\;\n(t|_p=l\\sigma\\land u=t[r\\sigma]_p)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"t\\to_R^S u\\iff(t,u)\\in\\to_R^S.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[t\\to_R^S u\\iff(t,u)\\in\\to_R^S.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每条规则的左右项具有同一排序，左项不是变量，右项不引入新变量。这里先把一步关系写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_S\\times T^{\\circ}\">\\(T_S\\times T^{\\circ}\\)</span> 上的关系图，便于独立陈述并证明目标项具有源项排序；类型保持命题给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R^S\\subseteq T_S\\times T_S\">\\(\\to_R^S\\subseteq T_S\\times T_S\\)</span>。关系不是将底层任意替换无条件地套用到排序项上。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>，§6.5.6，印刷第256页，OCR页块277。已比对同排序规则、非变量左项及右侧变量限制；位置式一步图是依据定义2.2.4与本书“归约关系按预期定义”的本地显式展开。OCR页块序号不等同于物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0eb06f5a064870f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-many-sorted-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"2d69158e5cbd8317","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-many-sorted-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-variables","status":"resolved","id":"491e726b9c1f42b0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-position","status":"resolved","id":"da02033e6d596cae","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-position]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-subterm","status":"resolved","id":"c3157a722a0edf96","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-subterm]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-replace","status":"resolved","id":"b58d01262349aaf3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-replace]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-terms","status":"resolved","id":"0eb06f5a064870f0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M$、$\\mathcal V_\\bullet$、$\\mathcal V$、$T_s$、$T_S$ 与 $T^{\\circ}$ 如 [[56-df-many-sorted-terms]]；排序替换集见 [[56-df-many-sorted-substitution]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-many-sorted-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"2d69158e5cbd8317","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt